  "body": "600m² Freehold | 7 Bedrooms | 2 Living | Double Garage\r\n\r\nSpace, privacy and unbeatable convenience come together at 15 Tangelo Avenue, Bucklands Beach. Privately positioned at the end of a quiet cul-de-sac and bordering a scenic reserve, this substantial family home is within easy walking distance of Highland Park Shopping Centre, PAK’nSAVE and Pakuranga College.\r\n\r\nSet on a level 600m² (mol) freehold site with approx. 180m² floor area, this solid brick and weatherboard home offers 7 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms and 2 living areas across two levels – ideal for large or extended families.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n• 600m² (mol) level freehold section. Approx. 180m² floor area\r\n• Solid brick & weatherboard construction\r\n• 7 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms & 2 living areas\r\n• Flexible 4+3-bedroom configuration\r\n• Open-plan kitchen & dining\r\n• Fully fenced front & rear lawns, vegetable yards, fruit trees\r\n• Freestanding double garage + ample off-street parking\r\n• Peaceful reserve-side cul-de-sac setting\r\n• Walk to Highland Park Shopping Centre, PAK’nSAVE & Pakuranga College\r\n\r\nThe ground floor features 4 bedrooms, a living area, bathroom, separate toilet and laundry. Separate access provides excellent flexibility for extended family, teenagers, guests or working from home.\r\n\r\nUpstairs offers 3 bedrooms, a spacious lounge, bathroom and separate toilet, plus a bright open-plan kitchen and dining area with excellent storage and bench space.\r\n\r\nOutside, generous fully fenced front and rear lawns provide plenty of room for children, pets and entertaining, complemented by a freestanding double garage and ample parking for multiple vehicles, a boat or caravan.\r\n\r\nWalk to Shops, Schools & Recreation\r\n\r\nThe location is a standout. Highland Park Shopping Centre, PAK’nSAVE and Pakuranga College are all within walking distance, while the neighbouring reserve, football facilities and Lloyd Elsmore Park Pool & Leisure Centre put recreation close to home. Botany Town Centre is also only a short drive away.\r\n\r\nZoned for Pakuranga College, Farm Cove Intermediate and Wakaaranga School, this is a superb location for family living.\r\n\r\nOffering space, flexibility, walkability and future potential, this is a rare opportunity in a highly convenient Bucklands Beach location.\r\n\r\nDon’t miss out – call us today or join us at the open home!",
